#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:2
msgid "Stream a tool round trip"
msgstr "流式展示一次工具往返"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:4
msgid "Turn a Python function into a tool and show its progress in your application. The model asks for ``add``, receives ``42``, and produces a final answer."
msgstr "把一个 Python 函数变成工具，并在你的应用中显示它的进度。模型请求 ``add``，收到 ``42``，然后给出最终回答。"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:8
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:10
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下："

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:16
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:22
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序使用确定性的离线模型，并在需要时使用临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:26
msgid "The three pieces to reuse"
msgstr "可复用的三个部分"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:28
msgid "**Define the capability.** Type annotations describe the arguments, and the docstring tells the model when to call it:"
msgstr "**定义能力。**\\ 类型注解描述参数，文档字符串告诉模型何时调用它："

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:35
msgid "**Display progress.** Event callbacks receive reasoning, the tool call, its result, and incremental answer text:"
msgstr "**显示进度。**\\ 事件回调会收到推理、工具调用、工具结果以及增量的回答文本："

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:42
msgid "**Connect them to a client.** Replace ``MathModel()`` with your provider when you are ready to make real requests:"
msgstr "**连接到客户端。**\\ 当你准备好发出真实请求时，把 ``MathModel()`` 替换成你的模型提供商："

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:49
msgid "The scripted model always calls the tool. A real model chooses whether to call it, and may not return visible reasoning even when it reasons internally."
msgstr "预设脚本的模型总是调用工具。真实的模型会自行决定是否调用，而且即使内部进行了推理，也可能不会返回可见的推理内容。"

#: ../../examples/streaming-tools.rst:53
msgid "Complete source"
msgstr "完整源码"

