msgid "Next: :doc:`../learn/streaming` for event handling and cancellation, or :doc:`../learn/tools` for schemas, errors, and safe execution."
msgstr "下一步：阅读\\ :doc:`../learn/streaming`\\ 了解事件处理和取消，或阅读\\ :doc:`../learn/tools`\\ 了解模式、错误和安全执行。"

